 "remarks": "With its storybook brick exterior, sun filled rooms, and character around every corner, this Tudor has a charm that's hard to find. Inside, beautiful hardwood floors and a cozy living room fireplace welcome you in, while the spacious kitchen features granite countertops, a gas range, and plenty of room to gather. Upstairs, the primary bedroom opens to its own private balcony, alongside a spacious second bedroom, a flexible home office or guest room, and a full bath complete with a steam shower/sauna and jetted soaking tub. The finished lower level offers additional living space, a full bath, laundry, and storage. Out back, a private fenced yard, covered deck, patio, and garden space set the scene for summer barbecues and slow mornings. Complete with a two-car garage, recently replaced roofs (2024 main house and 2026 garage), and a convenient Bettswood location near shopping, dining, parks, and commuter routes.",
